  "name": "Question 2",
  "problem": "A daycare center can take care of between $10$ and $20$ children. The fee that parents must pay each month depends on the number of children enrolled in the center. If there are $10$ children enrolled, parents must pay $$40.$ On the other hand, if there are more than $10$ children enrolled, the price drops by $$2$ for each child. All the parents pay the same monthly fee.\n\nHow many children must enroll for the center to maximize its revenue?",
